From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:29:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: Add CAMSS and CSIPHY block
 definitions

Describe the CAMSS and CSIPHY blocks on SM8750 so that camera pipelines
can be enabled by board device trees.

The camera subsystem contains:
- 6 x CSIPHY (CSI Physical Layer)
- 3 x TPG (Test Pattern Generator)
- 3 x CSID (CSI Decoder)
- 2 x CSID Lite
- 3 x VFE (Video Front End), 5 RDI per VFE
- 2 x VFE Lite, 4 RDI per VFE Lite

[Backport: Insert the PHY include into the Linux 7.3.3 SM8750 header list.]

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20261114-add-support-for-camss-on-sm8750-v7-14-8ff2a11835f6@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Hangxiang Ma <hangxiang.ma@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Wenmeng Liu <wenmeng.liu@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
